//RS /// c109 Phase 13: a resolved handle-method op, one per handle arm of
//RS /// built-in method lowering. The handle-receiver branch
//RS /// (keyed on `rty == Some(Named(<handle>))`) is decided ONCE at lowering from the
//RS /// total `recv_type` — emit only formats. Args are emitted plainly (raw `arg(i)`).
//RS /// `{root}` denotes `cx.root_prefix` (program-level, read at emit).
//RS /// Checked embedded-hardware operation metadata. The operation identity is
//RS /// resolved from the selected target profile before lowering; adapters marshal
//RS /// these facts and never rediscover board paths or widths.
